erverAgent.java, play_ironclad.py"], ["v1.1", "Phase 1: Core Observer & Baseline Bot", "Runs #2\u2013#4", 33, "Map Boss node at currY==14 not clicked; TreasureRoomBoss map loop; Slime Boss 35-dmg Slam & Automaton Hyperbeam.", "Added currY==14 bossHb click; TreasureRoomBoss map close + Proceed; +250 score bonus to split Slime Boss <=70 HP.", "play_ironclad.py"], ["v1.2", "Phase 2: Act 2 Scaling & Multi-Enemy AoE", "Runs #5\u2013#8", 48, "Reached Floor 48 (Act 3) for the first time! Lost to Jaw Worm Horde & 3 Cultists due to slow scaling and HandCardSelectScreen counter staying 0.", "Fixed HandCardSelectScreen numSelected via max(numSelected, len(selectedCards)); boosted Ritual/Cultist focus-fire (+45) and AoE (Immolate/Whirlwind).", "StsObserverAgent.java, play_ironclad.py"], ["v1.3", "Phase 3: First Floor 50 Boss & Act 3 Hazards", "Run #9", 50, "Reached Floor 50 (Awakened One)! Lost because bot played minor Powers in Phase 1, triggering Curiosity (+2 Strength per Power).", "Added Awakened One Curiosity check: suppress non-essential Powers during Phase 1 unless Demon Form, Barricade, or Corruption+Snecko Eye.", "play_ironclad.py"], ["v1.4", "Phase 3: First Floor 50 Boss & Act 3 Hazards", "Runs #10\u2013#11", 33, "Coffee Dripper disabled Campfire Rest without Reaper/Meal Ticket sustain; PotionPopUp.targetMode set isHidden=true.", "Penalized Coffee Dripper/Runic Dome/Velvet Choker; checked PotionPopUp.targetMode before isHidden so targetable potions never get stuck.", "play_ironclad.py"], ["v1.5", "Phase 3: First Floor 50 Boss & Act 3 Hazards", "Runs #12\u2013#13", 46, "Run #12 died on Floor 46 hitting Spiker's Thorns with multi-hit attacks; Run #13 picked Mind Bloom [I am Awake] (Mark of the Bloom) because of #g/#r color codes.", "Stripped LibGDX #g/#r/#y/#b/#p color tags in handle_event; forced Mind Bloom [I am War]; added universal Thorns self-damage protection.", "play_ironclad.py"], ["v1.6", "Phase 4: Event Mini-Games & Multi-Card Grid Select", "Runs #14\u2013#16", 27, "GremlinMatchGame (Match and Keep) had 0 dialog options; Astrolabe (numCards=3) re-clicked the same card index and toggled selection off.", "Added 4x3 card grid matcher for GremlinMatchGame; tracked grid_selected_indices in handle_grid_select for Astrolabe/Empty Cage.", "play_ironclad.py"], ["v1.7", "Phase 4: Event Mini-Games & Multi-Card Grid Select", "Run #17", 31, "Lethal attack bonus (+360) was computed before the if/elif chain and overwritten by sc = 100.0 + total_dmg * 3.8; Second Wind played with 0 non-attacks.", "Moved universal Attack post-scoring (Thorns + is_lethal_hit) after the if/elif chain; fixed Second Wind block multiplier & Fiend Fire hit count.", "play_ironclad.py"], ["v2.0", "Phase 5: Endgame Boss Mastery & Victory", "Run #18", 50, "Reached Floor 50 (Time Eater) at 85/90 HP and brought Time Eater to 106 HP! Wasted 5 cards into Time Eater's <50% HP Haste turn and took Madness in WindingHalls.", "Added Time Eater Haste conservation (only play Powers/Limit Break when Time Eater intents BUFF at <228 HP) and WindingHalls [Retrace Your Steps] preference.", "play_ironclad.py"], ["v2.1", "Phase 5: Endgame Boss Mastery & Victory", "Run #19", 46, "Lost on Floor 46 to Nemesis because bot evaluated 2-cost Attacks at full damage while Nemesis had Intangible (which caps all damage to 1 per hit).", "Added Intangible detection (eff_card_dmg = min(eff_card_dmg, 1)); blocked >=2-cost 0-block attacks and HP-cost cards into Intangible; avoided late Act 3 Elites.", "play_ironclad.py"], ["v2.2", "Phase 5: Endgame Boss Mastery & Victory", "Run #20", 50, "Beat both Reptomancer & Nemesis and reached Floor 50 (Time Eater)! Gambling Chip discarded entire Turn 1 hand; stopping at 11/12 Time Warp left 1 play for Turn 5.", "Fixed Gambling Chip to only discard Strikes/Defends/Curses; changed Time Warp rule to stop only at 6..8 when safe and push through 9..11 to reset to 0/12; boosted Boss Block urgency.", "play_ironclad.py"], ["v2.3", "Phase 5: Endgame Boss Mastery & Victory", "Run #21 (VICTORY!)", 51, "Defeated Donu and Deca on Floor 50 in 7 turns at 71/93 HP! Map screen opened when MonsterRoomBoss completed.", "Closed Map overlay when MonsterRoomBoss is COMPLETE and clicked Proceed to enter Floor 51 Spire Heart & Victory Screen (Score: 667 in 13m 21s).", "play_ironclad.py"]]}, {"op": "write", "range": "Enemy Summary!A1", "data": [["Enemy_Encounter", "Encounters_Fought", "Avg_Damage_Taken", "Max_Damage_Taken", "Avg_Turns", "Total_Damage_Taken"], ["Jaw Worm", 17, 7.6, 15, 3.8, 130], ["Cultist", 17, 5.2, 12, 3.6, 88], ["Small Slimes", 15, 5.1, 22, 3.7, 76], ["2 Louse", 14, 4.3, 11, 3.1, 60], ["Snake Plant", 12, 11.2, 42, 3.5, 134], ["Centurion and Healer", 12, 18.3, 35, 4.7, 220], ["2 Fungi Beasts", 11, 6.5, 22, 3.2, 71], ["Large Slime", 11, 11.9, 29, 6.3, 131], ["2 Thieves", 9, 15.7, 28, 3.2, 141], ["Snecko", 9, 12.0, 20, 3.8, 108], ["Lagavulin", 8, 30.4, 44, 7.5, 243], ["Slime Boss", 8, 49.0, 81, 10.8, 392], ["The Guardian", 8, 50.0, 70, 10.1, 400], ["3 Louse", 8, 6.1, 16, 3.9, 49], ["3 Darklings", 8, 19.6, 47, 4.5, 157], ["Chosen", 7, 3.3, 11, 3.1, 23], ["Shell Parasite", 7, 16.6, 33, 4.4, 116], ["Slavers", 7, 39.6, 73, 5.6, 277], ["Gremlin Nob", 7, 14.0, 29, 3.6, 98], ["Exordium Thugs", 7, 14.9, 23, 4.7, 104], ["Spheric Guardian", 7, 18.0, 37, 4.1, 126], ["Cultist and Chosen", 7, 18.9, 56, 5.4, 132], ["Red Slaver", 6, 10.2, 15, 3.7, 61], ["Looter", 6, 6.5, 17, 3.5, 39], ["Exordium Wildlife", 6, 5.7, 9, 4.5, 34], ["Chosen and Byrds", 6, 13.3, 26, 5.3, 80], ["3 Sentries", 6, 25.3, 56, 8.2, 152], ["Champ", 6, 40.3, 69, 6.5, 242], ["3 Shapes", 6, 23.7, 61, 3.7, 142], ["Spire Growth", 6, 23.7, 41, 4.2, 142], ["3 Cultists", 5, 26.8, 47, 4.8, 134], ["Shelled Parasite and Fungi", 5, 13.2, 24, 3.6, 66], ["Orb Walker", 5, 7.8, 18, 2.8, 39], ["Sphere and 2 Shapes", 5, 25.4, 41, 4.2, 127], ["Hexaghost", 5, 45.6, 51, 8.6, 228], ["Gremlin Gang", 5, 21.0, 40, 4.0, 105], ["Collector", 4, 59.5, 122, 8.0, 238], ["The Mushroom Lair", 4, 14.0, 25,